{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"fdb2e25bbb2ac43b","name":"card_event_stubborn_defense","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Poland/events/card_event_stubborn_defense","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"STUBBORN DEFENSE","text":"When a friendly unit is attacked, give it +1 defense before damage. Draw a card if your unit survives.","flavorText":"The Battle of Westerplatte was fought between 1-7 September in 1939 in the Free City of Danzig, now Gdańsk, and is one of the first battles of WWII. The heroic Polish defense against the overwhelming German forces was at the time an inspiration for the Polish Army and is still considered a symbol of Polish fight for freedom in the 20th century. The battle ended with the surrender of the Polish forces, but during the course of the fight they managed to repel 13 assaults that were supported by dive bomber attacks and naval bombardment. Of the approximately Polish 200 defenders, 15 were killed and 40 wounded, the rest were captured. Approximately 200 Germans were killed in the battle and 150 were wounded.","faction":"Poland","type":"gotcha","rarity":"Common","cost":0,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_stubborn_defense","title":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_event_stubborn_defense_title","SourceString":"STUBBORN DEFENSE","LocalizedString":"STUBBORN DEFENSE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::gotcha","faction":"EFactionEnum::Poland","Text":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_event_stubborn_defense_text","SourceString":"When a friendly unit is attacked, give it +1 defense before damage. Draw a card if your unit survives.","LocalizedString":"When a friendly unit is attacked, give it +1 defense before damage. Draw a card if your unit survives."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_event_stubborn_defense_history","SourceString":"The Battle of Westerplatte was fought between 1-7 September in 1939 in the Free City of Danzig, now Gdańsk, and is one of the first battles of WWII. The heroic Polish defense against the overwhelming German forces was at the time an inspiration for the Polish Army and is still considered a symbol of Polish fight for freedom in the 20th century. The battle ended with the surrender of the Polish forces, but during the course of the fight they managed to repel 13 assaults that were supported by dive bomber attacks and naval bombardment. Of the approximately Polish 200 defenders, 15 were killed and 40 wounded, the rest were captured. Approximately 200 Germans were killed in the battle and 150 were wounded.","LocalizedString":"The Battle of Westerplatte was fought between 1-7 September in 1939 in the Free City of Danzig, now Gdańsk, and is one of the first battles of WWII. The heroic Polish defense against the overwhelming German forces was at the time an inspiration for the Polish Army and is still considered a symbol of Polish fight for freedom in the 20th century. The battle ended with the surrender of the Polish forces, but during the course of the fight they managed to repel 13 assaults that were supported by dive bomber attacks and naval bombardment. Of the approximately Polish 200 defenders, 15 were killed and 40 wounded, the rest were captured. Approximately 200 Germans were killed in the battle and 150 were wounded."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isReserved":true,"usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardAttacks","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardSurvivedCombat","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnEndOfTurn"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Combat"],"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Poland/t_stubborn_defense2.t_stubborn_defense2","SubPathString":""},"ImageAnchor":"EImageAnchor::Top","artist":"Jarosław Wróbel","historyPho